The charter states that each member pays a yearly contribution. The amount of this contribution is fixed in the annex of the charter. [[cite:obs-ff1efdabbc393a33d4fc1eca93715ee075594fc5 "Each member pays a yearly contribution; the amount is fixed in the annex of this charter."]]

According to the annex, the ordinary contribution is one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January. [[cite:obs-92461bee3f0f7ca1e39bf0c463f179ebbf539f8e "Ordinary contributions: one hundred twenty (120) EUR, payable within January."]]